atlas interactions

interaction territory-front-opens-local-conversation
  source human-community-body
  destination page-composition
  relation public-conversation-discovery
  preserves exact root-namespace community and post identities, published visibility, moderation standing, bounded candidate selection and original thread continuation
  drops private membership, actor-specific state, replies in previews, inferred territory classification and all write authority
  forbidden_inference a public conversation entrance -> membership, external-network enrollment or publication permission
  invalidates_on public selection, community visibility or policy, post content or moderation standing changing
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/community_journey.test.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreCMS/src/community_discovery.h
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/front_community.h

interaction project-delta-producer-publishes-to-mcp-gateway
  source project-delta-producer
  destination mcp-recursive-native-overlay
  relation local_git_snapshot_to_authenticated_delta_intake
  preserves status hash, head, branch, upstream, bounded working/staged summaries, local journal and bearer-gated HTTP publication
  drops source mutation authority, guaranteed delivery on an ambiguous response, and historical remote completeness when pending is replaced
  forbidden_inference an accepted delta or a local journal entry -> a complete project history, a verified claim, or permission to edit source
  invalidates_on Git status format, journal encoding, gateway delta schema, token admission or retry policy changing
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/project_delta_watcher.test.mjs
  binding integrations/mcp/project_delta_watcher.mjs
  binding integrations/mcp/recursive_overlay.mjs

interaction decision-program-uses-shared-typed-runtime
  source decision-program
  destination decision-plane
  relation authored_source_questions_to_shared_numeric_execution
  preserves one source per semantic record, authored criteria, complete probability distributions, expected ordinal score, bounded concurrency, cancellation and diagnostic-only owner posture
  drops duplicate provider registry and answer validator, unrelated-source joint-schema batching and provider confidence as a common decision threshold
  forbidden_inference shared decision algebra or concurrent execution -> calibrated source classification, fewer provider calls or authorized source changes
  invalidates_on typed schema, provider semantics, source descriptor or authored diagnostic thresholds changing
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/decision_program_plane.test.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/decision_program_plane.mjs

interaction decision-plane-projects-context-cut
  source context-cut-compiler
  destination decision-plane
  relation exact_receipted_passage_to_typed_diagnostic
  preserves selected candidate identity, ForeignTwin receipt, body digest, ADMIT versus SHADOW gate, information-policy class, purpose, and recoverable frontier
  drops unrelated unselected bodies, private hosted state, source authority, and any claim that semantic relevance is evidence completeness
  forbidden_inference a model passage score -> permission to execute a SHADOW context or omit an exact-owner obligation
  invalidates_on selected candidate, body digest, purpose, rank gate, information policy, or model program changing
  witness cmd/BonfyreContextCut/tests/context_cut_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreContextCut/context_cut.mjs

interaction decision-plane-projects-mcp-shortlist
  source mcp-recursive-native-overlay
  destination decision-plane
  relation exact_read_only_tool_shortlist_to_typed_diagnostic
  preserves tool identity, read-only annotation, exact shortlist, intent and non-effecting model distribution
  drops effecting tools, arbitrary model-invented tool names, bearer credentials, and invocation authority
  forbidden_inference a suggested tool -> authorization to call it or proof that its result is true
  invalidates_on tool catalogue, shortlist, intent, permission annotation, or decision program changing
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/recursive_overlay.test.mjs
  binding integrations/mcp/recursive_overlay.mjs

interaction decision-plane-projects-flow-work
  source work-graph
  destination decision-plane
  relation exact_work_role_shortlist_to_typed_diagnostic
  preserves work identity, exact read digest, candidate role identities and distribution
  drops effect admission, leases, external calls, and model-generated authority
  forbidden_inference a model work phenotype -> a claim, assignment, authorized transition, or completed effect
  invalidates_on work read set, role shortlist, information policy, or decision program changing
