interaction residual-work-compiles-decision-frontiers
  source live-gym
  destination decision-plane
  relation measured_residual_to_normal_typed_work_plan
  preserves source receipt digest, CUE-mapped owner role, closable versus human-decision distinction, private information policy and explicit abstention
  drops automatic model execution, generated role identities as authority, and model-driven goal submission
  forbidden_inference a compiled work frontier -> a model assessment, queue claim, or permission to close a residual
