  binding scripts/residual-to-work.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreDecision/frontier-adapters.mjs

interaction decision-plane-derives-context-cut
  source decision-plane
  destination decision-cut
  relation held_out_measured_token_representation_derivation
  preserves original ContextCut, body and token digests, candidate identities, question probabilities, omitted recoverable frontier and measured evaluation receipt
  drops model text generation, source truth, authorization, and every claim that omission proves irrelevance
