  source protocol-contract
  destination decision-plane
  relation exact_outstanding_obligation_to_reconstructable_typed_case
  preserves native commitment event, authored role set, queue status and attempt, private information policy, exact read fingerprint and existing queue tuple shape
  drops duplicate durable decision state, automatic hosted inference, committer reassignment, claims and discharge authority
  forbidden_inference a model phenotype, urgency or review suggestion -> an authorized effect, queue claim, reassignment or discharged commitment
