interaction decision-program-reviews-source-frontier
  source decision-program
  destination source-frontier
  relation bounded_model_diagnostic_of_exact_admitted_sources
  preserves exact admitted channel identity, source descriptor, model selector, typed question schema, request and response digests, uncertainty, disagreement, and operator-review state
  drops raw credentials, model-generated prose, unbounded source enumeration, automatic admission, publication, and effects
  forbidden_inference a Clef answer or agreement between models -> source truth, rights, authority, program membership, or permission to fetch or publish
