interaction representation-manifold-native-arrow-transport
  source representation-manifold
  destination representation-manifold
  relation verified_physical_to_columnar_transport
  preserves the canonical Parquet input digest and frontier, a content-addressed Flight catalog, native executable identity, and separate installed versus serving states
  drops JSON object-graph marshalling, duplicate resident Arrow bodies, semantic authority, and any claim that a transport binding proves a live service
  forbidden_inference a valid Arrow IPC stream or Flight batch -> semantic truth, owner adoption, remote access authority, or a service currently running
  invalidates_on canonical Parquet bytes, representation frontier, native bundle digest, catalog digest, or registered transport receipt changing
