interaction representation-manifold-native-adbc-admission
  source representation-manifold
  destination representation-manifold
  relation local_driver_abi_to_unserved_receipt
  preserves exact native driver and probe digests, accepted ADBC ABI version, and distinct initialized versus connected or serving states
  drops Python import as a runtime readiness test, implicit package installation, and any claim that a loaded driver executed SQL
  forbidden_inference a successfully initialized ADBC driver -> a Flight SQL connection, query result, authenticated endpoint, or live service
  invalidates_on native driver bytes, probe bytes, ADBC ABI callback table, or recorded receipt changing
  witness scripts/tests/representation-manifold-adbc.test.mjs
  binding scripts/representation-manifold-adbc.mjs

interaction rate-discovery-offers-meter-evidence
  source rate-discovery
  destination cmd-meter
  relation evidence_bound_rate_admission
  preserves provider coordinate, stated amount, stated currency, response date, and HTTP 402 evidence
  drops the source body after bounded inspection, source claims without a qualified denomination, and any inference of usage or settlement
  forbidden_inference a successful 402 probe -> a Meter rate; only the Meter command's success is admission
  invalidates_on a changed source statement, robots policy, rate denomination, or native Meter verdict
  witness scripts/tests/sweep_rates.test.mjs
  binding scripts/sweep-rates.mjs
# Cross-architecture contracts. Often more important than architecture interiors:
# the hardest bugs live in the bridges. Each names what it preserves, what it
# drops, and what it must NOT promote.

interaction placement-plane-preserves-owner-boundaries
  source placement-plane
  destination address-plane
  relation provider_neutral_delivery_placement
  preserves declared public origin, control-path exclusion, service identity, failure posture and the fact that delivery is only a realization
  drops provider-native route identifiers, tunnel credentials, bearer material, semantic owner state and authority decisions
  forbidden_inference an addressable route or Cloudflare delivery plan -> eligibility, authority, publication standing, effect permission or semantic ownership
  invalidates_on placement declaration, public origin, route exclusion, owner binding or provider receipt changing
  witness scripts/tests/placement_plane_test.sh
  binding tools/compile_placement_plane.mjs

interaction placement-plane-projects-oauth-continuity
  source placement-plane
  destination cmd-auth
  relation sealed_transaction_continuity
  preserves code digest, client/redirect/PKCE binding, requested scope, expiry and a sealed session envelope for atomic single-use exchange
  drops private signing keys, raw bearer material, user/password identity data, institution grants, effect authority and issuer ownership
  forbidden_inference a durable OAuth transaction projection -> a valid session, authorization decision, renewed grant or ability to mint authority
  invalidates_on code consumption, expiry, native session revocation, placement generation replacement or credential-boundary rotation
  witness scripts/tests/placement_plane_test.sh
  binding deploy/supabase/placement-plane.sql
  binding integrations/mcp/bonfyre_oauth_gateway.mjs

interaction placement-plane-persists-spatial-projection
  source spatial-observation
  destination placement-plane
  relation last_proven_spatial_projection
  preserves occurrence-keyed observation/frontier references, immutable material target, query projection target and last-proven public projection posture
  drops geometry as a routing term, subject identity ownership, disclosure decisions, authority, effect rights and a claim that a projection is a source observation
  forbidden_inference a spatial projection surviving an Oracle outage -> a new observation, currently valid position, disclosure right or authoritative spatial answer
  invalidates_on source receipt/retraction, observation frontier, projection generation or retention decision changing
