interaction estate-bridges-into-discipl
  source foreign-twin
  destination discipl-composition
  relation retained_representation_becomes_composable_material
  preserves the occurrence a body came from, the digest of what was served, and the measured rate at which an attempted observation still has bytes on disk
  preserves carrier conformance as the only licence for a kind narrower than `file`; a body is text because it parsed as a feed, not because its phenotype suggested it might
  drops the phenotype's own account of what the source offers, which describes the source and not the bytes this estate retained from it
  drops any carrier the conformance compiler has never actually detected here; an unobserved probe contributes no family and no edge
  forbidden_inference a retained body entering the lattice -> a transform having run; the bridge seeds contracts and executes nothing
  forbidden_inference a composable body -> a right to redistribute what it contains
  forbidden_inference the estate-wide retention rate -> the rate for any one phenotype or carrier
  binding lib/libbonfyre/src/bf_discipl.c
  note the bridge exists because the estate read a gigabyte into 2,882 files and stopped. Ingest has consumed `file` the whole time; nothing had told the composition engine that the estate holds any.

interaction plane-ranks-into-pure-reduction
  source bitnet-address-ranker
  destination pure-execution-tier
  relation ranked_frontier_enters_bounded_reduction
  preserves the deterministic membership AddressPlane decided, unchanged: the reducer receives exactly the survivors the mask cut admitted, in whatever order the ranker chose
  preserves the survivor set against the order it arrived in; the same 48-candidate weather frontier reduced in rank order, reversed rank order and plane order returns one set digest across reference, hvm2 and hvm4
  drops the ranker's authority to remove a candidate. Ordering is presentation here and nothing else, which is what makes a ranker measured worse than chance harmless in this position
  drops any claim that a Bend aggregate is order-free; it sums indices, so its checksum moves with the order and is only comparable against a reference computed in the same order
  forbidden_inference a ranker safe in this position -> a ranker fit to truncate; the safety comes from the reducer computing the whole frontier, and a top-k cut would put the measured unfitness straight into the answer
  forbidden_inference agreement across three orderings -> correctness; it shows the computation does not depend on sequence, which is a smaller and different thing
  forbidden_inference a survivor here -> a reachable, admitted, quoted or purchasable source
  binding scripts/pure-job.mjs
  note the chain was assembled to find out whether a SHADOW ranker could drive a bounded search. It cannot choose the prefix -- 91 percent of random draws beat its top-16 -- and it can safely choose the order, because an exact reducer over the whole frontier is immune to being handed things in a bad sequence.

interaction discipl-asks-the-pure-tier
  source discipl-composition
  destination pure-execution-tier
  relation composition_question_stated_for_bounded_reduction
  preserves the chains the composition engine found and the cost, confidence and drift it assigned them, scaled to integers because the lattice compares integers and a float disagreeing in the last bit would present as two reducers disagreeing about a pure computation
  preserves the tier's boundary: the engine states the question in the tier's job shape and never dispatches a reducer itself, so purity is still checked before dispatch and placement is still asked per backend
  drops the engine's own ranking; a portfolio is a subset-sum over accumulated cost and the order chains were proposed in says nothing about which combinations fit
  drops any backend that cannot express the lattice, by refusal rather than by answering an easier question
  forbidden_inference a feasible portfolio -> a runnable one; these chains are contracts and most of their commands still have no checked invocation
  forbidden_inference accumulated transform cost -> money, time or energy
  forbidden_inference a budget that fits -> authority to spend it
  forbidden_inference agreement between the net and enumeration -> a correct cost model; both were handed the same declared priors
  binding cmd/BonfyreDiscipl/src/main.c
  note DisCIPL scored chains with declared priors and nothing else could compute the same thing, so the scores had no second opinion. This is the first one: two reducers arriving at one feasible set by routes with nothing in common.

