  preserves the published activation's pack, subject, scope and declared conditions, and a dependency edge on every pack head the activation transitively declares
  drops overlay composition, precedence order, refused verbs and the resolved closure -- none of which the plane can compute
  forbidden_inference a forwarded activation -> a resolved closure or an applied overlay
  forbidden_inference an activation surviving the cut -> an authorized verb; activating is not authorizing and Authority still decides at effect time
  forbidden_inference a pack reaching the plane -> a pack being an addressable subject
  invalidates_on the activation, its pack head, or any declared dependency head is published (reheat)
