interaction the-plane-names-candidates-and-never-decides-truth
  source address-plane
  destination spatial-observation
  relation candidate_naming
  preserves which subjects could possibly participate at a coarse extent, computed from region, cell, scale and mobility alone
  drops any claim about those subjects' actual state; the surviving advertisements name candidate subjects and are never used as the set of facts about them
  forbidden_inference an advertised observation -> the current or historical position of its subject; the owner answers from its complete log, including facts that were never advertised
  forbidden_inference a subject failing the coarse cut -> that subject having no position; it failed a narrowing, not a query
  forbidden_inference a stale advertisement -> a stale answer; the advertisement decides participation and the log decides position
  invalidates_on the compiled advertisement generation is replaced, or a fact for a candidate subject is appended (reheat)
