interaction the-live-frontier-is-maintained-and-the-past-is-recomputed
  source spatial-observation
  destination occurrence-spine
  relation incremental_maintenance
  preserves the latest known fact per subject, advanced from the facts that arrived rather than from the whole log, with a watermark saying how far it has caught up
  drops nothing from the log; the maintained view is derived, disposable, and rebuildable from the facts at any time
  forbidden_inference a maintained view -> a second source of truth; a maintained read and a recomputed read must agree and a disagreement is a defect in the maintenance
  forbidden_inference a stored latest fact -> an assertion that it holds now; effectiveness and expiry are decided at read time against the instant asked about
  forbidden_inference a retraction -> something that can be patched forward; only appends move the answer in one direction, so a retraction recomputes the subject it touched
  forbidden_inference a historical frontier -> something a maintained view can answer; it knows only what it has caught up to, so a live read is refused while it is behind
  invalidates_on any fact is appended or retracted (the watermark falls behind)
  witness cmd/BonfyreSpatial/tests/spatial_test.sh (maintained and recomputed reads agree before and after a retraction; a live read is refused while the view is behind; expiry still applies through it)
  binding cmd/BonfyreSpatial/src/main.c

interaction the-cold-representation-is-the-same-facts
  source spatial-observation
  destination compression-law
  relation representation_lowering
  preserves every field of every fact, verified by row count, identity sum and a digest over the fields that carry meaning, and restorable into a store that answers the same closure the same way
  drops 254 MB down to 3.3 MB on a million facts, which is representation and not content
  forbidden_inference a verified cold copy -> an authority to delete the hot store, or a retention decision of any kind
  forbidden_inference a matching row count -> matching facts; equality here is by content because a count proves only that nothing was dropped
  forbidden_inference a cold tier -> a queryable one; the hot store is where the log is read, and the cold copy is thawed before it answers anything
  invalidates_on a fact is appended after the export (the hot store and the cold copy stop being identical, and verify says so)
  witness cmd/BonfyreSpatial/tests/spatial_test.sh (identical by content; a hot store that moved on reported as different; a thawed store answering the same closure identically)
