  preserves a per-phenotype invalidation set on every facet, so a projection thaws when the thing it projects changes and not when anything about the subject changes
  drops the coupling that would make more protocol projections mean more recomputation; a moving thing invalidates its position and its live projections and touches neither its route identity nor its fare policy
